Subject: Big-endian: host-ordered byte members of RCT12 research items and track elements; test hooks

- RCT12ResearchItem: RawValue is swapped, so the byte view follows host order
- RCT12TrackElement: Sequence/Colour declared in host order and bytes 5/6
  swapped for every track element (no maze lookup)
- simulate <park> <ticks> [output park]: saves the park uncompressed afterwards
- OPENRCT2_FIXED_SEED: fixed scenario RNG seed; SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH: authoring
  timestamps (both to compare two builds)

